 "lines": {
  "zh": [
   [
    2,
    6.6,
    "narrator",
    "江湖風雨幾時休，一劍光寒十四州。"
   ],
   [
    6.9,
    11.6,
    "narrator",
    "月下竹林藏殺氣，掌中乾坤論恩仇。"
   ],
   [
    18,
    21.5,
    "yan",
    "天機劍譜……絕不能落入血蓮手中！"
   ],
   [
    24.6,
    27.4,
    "envoy",
    "燕飛霜，交出劍譜，留你全屍！"
   ],
   [
    27.7,
    29.3,
    "yan",
    "血蓮的狗，也配？"
   ],
   [
    48,
    50.6,
    "yan",
    "……還有人。出來！"
   ],
   [
    51,
    53,
    "ye",
    "哈哈哈哈……"
   ],
   [
    58.6,
    63,
    "ye",
    "血蓮開處萬骨枯，天下蒼生一念屠。"
   ],
   [
    63.4,
    68,
    "ye",
    "若問魔尊何處去，九幽門下盡我途。"
   ],
   [
    68.5,
    72.5,
    "ye",
    "燕飛霜，把劍譜交出來，本尊讓你死得痛快。"
   ],
   [
    73,
    75.3,
    "yan",
    "要劍譜，先問過我的刀！"
   ],
   [
    84.6,
    86,
    "ye",
    "血蓮掌！"
   ],
   [
    95.6,
    97.6,
    "ye",
    "去吧。"
   ],
   [
    104.5,
    109,
    "ling",
    "一劍霜寒照九州，白衣不染世間愁。"
   ],
   [
    109.4,
    114,
    "ling",
    "若問劍心何所在，月明千里一孤舟。"
   ],
   [
    114.5,
    118.8,
    "ye",
    "凌雲霄！十年前斷你師門，今日斷你性命！"
   ],
   [
    119.3,
    123.5,
    "ling",
    "十年前我留你一命，是我此生最大的錯。"
   ],
   [
    123.8,
    125.6,
    "ling",
    "燕姑娘，退下。"
   ],
   [
    154.8,
    157,
    "ye",
    "血蓮・九幽掌！"
   ],
   [
    158.2,
    159.6,
    "yan",
    "凌大俠！"
   ],
   [
    163.2,
    165.3,
    "ling",
    "霜天——一劍！"
   ],
   [
    168.8,
    172,
    "ye",
    "好……好一個凌雲霄！"
   ],
   [
    172.4,
    176,
    "ye",
    "陪本尊到九霄之上，再分生死！"
   ],
   [
    188.6,
    195.6,
    "narrator",
    "一輪明月，照盡江湖恩怨；一劍一掌，誰主沉浮？"
   ],
   [
    214.6,
    217,
    "ye",
    "萬魔——歸宗！"
   ],
   [
    224.8,
    227,
    "yan",
    "凌大俠，就是現在！"
   ],
   [
    229.1,
    230.4,
    "ling",
    "一劍——"
   ],
   [
    232,
    233.2,
    "ling",
    "月華！"
   ],
   [
    238,
    242.2,
    "ye",
    "哈……哈哈……本尊……不會就此……"
   ],
   [
    248.2,
    250.2,
    "yan",
    "他……死了嗎？"
   ],
   [
    250.6,
    255,
    "ling",
    "血蓮不死，江湖不寧。今夜，只是開始。"
   ],
   [
    255.4,
    258.4,
    "yan",
    "那天機劍譜……我們該怎麼辦？"
   ],
   [
    258.8,
    262,
    "ling",
    "先離開這裡。風，要變了。"
   ],
   [
    266,
    271.6,
    "narrator",
    "劍影月華今宵盡，江湖兒女幾人歸？"
   ],
   [
    272,
    278,
    "narrator",
    "欲知血蓮生死事，且待下回再分明。"
   ]
  ],
  "en": [
   [
    2,
    6.6,
    "narrator",
    "When will the storms of the rivers and lakes ever end? One sword’s cold light falls on fourteen provinces."
   ],
   [
    6.9,
    11.6,
    "narrator",
    "Death hides in the bamboo under the moon; in the palm of a hand, old debts are settled."
   ],
   [
    18,
    21.5,
    "yan",
    "The Heavenly Sword Manual... the Blood Lotus must never have it!"
   ],
   [
    24.6,
    27.4,
    "envoy",
    "Yan Feishuang! Give up the manual and we leave your body whole!"
   ],
   [
    27.7,
    29.3,
    "yan",
    "You? The Blood Lotus’s dogs?"
   ],
   [
    48,
    50.6,
    "yan",
    "...There is someone else. Show yourself!"
   ],
   [
    51,
    53,
    "ye",
    "Ha ha ha ha..."
   ],
   [
    58.6,
    63,
    "ye",
    "Where the blood lotus opens, ten thousand bones dry; a single thought of mine, and all beneath heaven is slaughtered."
   ],
   [
    63.4,
    68,
    "ye",
    "Ask where the Demon Lord goes: every gate of the Nine Netherworlds is my road."
   ],
   [
    68.5,
    72.5,
    "ye",
    "Yan Feishuang. Give me the manual, and I will let you die quickly."
   ],
   [
    73,
    75.3,
    "yan",
    "For the manual, ask my blades first!"
   ],
   [
    84.6,
    86,
    "ye",
    "Blood Lotus Palm!"
   ],
   [
    95.6,
    97.6,
    "ye",
    "Go now."
   ],
   [
    104.5,
    109,
    "ling",
    "One sword, frost-cold, over the nine provinces; a white robe the sorrows of the world cannot stain."
   ],
   [
    109.4,
    114,
    "ling",
    "Ask where the sword’s heart lies: a lone boat under a moon that shines a thousand miles."
   ],
   [
    114.5,
    118.8,
    "ye",
    "Ling Yunxiao! Ten years ago I ended your school; today I end your life!"
   ],
   [
    119.3,
    123.5,
    "ling",
    "Ten years ago I let you live. It was the greatest mistake of my life."
   ],
   [
    123.8,
    125.6,
    "ling",
    "Miss Yan. Stand back."
   ],
   [
    154.8,
    157,
    "ye",
    "Blood Lotus: Nine Netherworlds Palm!"
   ],
   [
    158.2,
    159.6,
    "yan",
    "Master Ling!"
   ],
   [
    163.2,
    165.3,
    "ling",
    "Frost Sky — One Sword!"
   ],
   [
    168.8,
    172,
    "ye",
    "Good... a fine swordsman, Ling Yunxiao!"
   ],
   [
    172.4,
    176,
    "ye",
    "Come with me, above the nine heavens, and we will see who dies!"
   ],
   [
    188.6,
    195.6,
    "narrator",
    "One bright moon over every grudge in the world; one sword, one palm: which will rise, and which will fall?"
   ],
   [
    214.6,
    217,
    "ye",
    "Ten Thousand Demons — Return to the Source!"
   ],
   [
    224.8,
    227,
    "yan",
    "Master Ling — now!"
   ],
   [
    229.1,
    230.4,
    "ling",
    "One Sword —"
   ],
   [
    232,
    233.2,
    "ling",
    "Moonlight!"
   ],
   [
    238,
    242.2,
    "ye",
    "Ha... ha ha... this is not... the end of me..."
   ],
   [
    248.2,
    250.2,
    "yan",
    "Is he... dead?"
   ],
   [
    250.6,
    255,
    "ling",
    "While the Blood Lotus lives, the world knows no peace. Tonight is only the beginning."
   ],
   [
    255.4,
    258.4,
    "yan",
    "And the sword manual... what do we do?"
   ],
   [
    258.8,
    262,
    "ling",
    "Leave this place first. The wind is turning."
   ],
   [
    266,
    271.6,
    "narrator",
    "The sword’s shadow and the moon’s light end with the night; of those who live by the sword, how many come home?"
   ],
   [
    272,
    278,
    "narrator",
    "Whether the Blood Lotus lives or dies, the next part will tell."
   ]
  ]
 },
